      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carver%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town's early economy hinged on iron ore from swamp lands, fueling cooking tool production by the 1730s.",
