      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carver%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By 1900 Carver farmers produced a fifth of all U.S. cranberries, thanks to reclaimed bogs.",
